        <th>Dosis Kalium Humat (70–80 %)</th>
        <th>Catatan Agronomi Kunci</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Kelapa Sawit — Pembibitan (Pre/Main Nursery)</strong></td>
